><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Dennis</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An overview of lung cancer genomics and proteomics</article-title><source>Am J Respir Cell Mol Biol</source><year>2005</year><volume>32</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>169</fpage><lpage>176</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1165/rcmb.F290</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Granville CA, Dennis PA. An overview of lung cancer genomics and proteomics. Am J Respir Cell Mol Biol. 2005;32(3):169&#x02013;76. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15713815</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR5"><label>5.</label><citation citation-type="other">National Statistics Online. <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.statistics.gov.uk/cci/nugget.asp?id=861">http://www.statistics.gov.uk/cci/nugget.asp?id=861</ext-link>. Accessed June 1, 2007.</citation></ref><ref id="CR6"><label>6.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Reed</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name><name><surname>Molloy</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dalton</surname><given-names>EL</given-names></name><name><surname>Howington</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Survival after resection for lung cancer is the outcome that matters</article-title><source>Am J Surg</source><year>2004</year><volume>188</volume><fpage>598</fpage><lpage>602</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.amjsurg.2004.07.037</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Reed MF, Molloy M, Dalton EL, Howington JA. Survival after resection for lung cancer is the outcome that matters. Am J Surg. 2004;188:598&#x02013;602. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15546578</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR7"><label>7.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cuzick</surname><given-names>J</given-n