logies and benefits for patients</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2003</year><volume>362</volume><issue>9382</issue><fpage>415</fpage><lpage>416</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(03)14096-2</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Banks R, Selby P. Clinical proteomics&#x02014;insights into pathologies and benefits for patients. Lancet. 2003;362(9382):415&#x02013;6. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12927423</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR15"><label>15.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Healy</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hayes</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Leonard</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Biosensor developments: application to prostate-specific antigen detection</article-title><source>Trends Biotechnol</source><year>2007</year><volume>25</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>125</fpage><lpage>131</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.tibtech.2007.01.004</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Healy DA, Hayes CJ, Leonard P, et al. Biosensor developments: application to prostate-specific antigen detection. Trends Biotechnol. 2007;25(3):125&#x02013;31. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17257699</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR16"><label>16.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Meyer</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Hartmann</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Krause</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>CRP determination based on a novel magnetic biosensor</article-title><source>Biosens Bioelectron</source><year>2007</year><volume>22</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>973</fpage><lpage>979</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.bios.2006.04.001</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Meyer MH, Hartmann M, Krause HJ, et al. CRP determination based on a novel magnetic biosensor. Biosens Bioelectron. 2007;22(6):973&#x02013;9. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16766177</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR17"><label>17.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Tang</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Dai</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>A disposable electrochemical immunosensor for flow injection immunoassay of carcinoembryonic antigen</article-title><source>Biosens Bioelectron</source><year>2006</year><volume>22</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>102</fpage><lpage>108</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.bios.2005.12.008</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Wu J, Tang J, Dai Z, et al. A disposable electrochemical immunosensor for flow injection immunoassay of carcinoembryonic antigen. Biosens Bioelectron. 2006;22(1):102&#x02013;8. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16427775</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR18"><label>18.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kikuchi</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Carbone</surname><given-names>DP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Proteomics analysis in lung cancer: challenges and opportunities</article-title><source>Respirology</source><year>2007</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>22</fpage><lpage>28</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1440-1843.2006.00957.x</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Kikuchi T, Carbone DP. Proteomics analysis in lung cancer: challenges and opportunities. Respirology. 2007;12:22&#x02013;8. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17207021</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR19"><label>19.</label><citation citation-type="journal